<pb facs="1078612" n="1"/>
  <opener>Vir Doctissime et Celeberrime</opener>
  <p><lb/>Quum per duos integros circiter menses frustra, <choice><abbr>Clariss.</abbr><expan>Clarissimi</expan></choice> Nepotis tui
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolai</rs> ad <rs key="B_991170517054405501 B_991170517054205501" type="letter">binas meas literas</rs> responsum<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Nicolaus I Bernoulli hatte Michelotti bereits am <rs key="B_991170517053905501" type="letter">15. Mai 1714</rs> geantwortet. Seine Antwort war jedoch zunächst nicht angekommen, wie sein <rs key="B_991170517053705501" type="letter">Brief vom 18. Juli 1714</rs> zeigt.</note> expectaverim, ex re fore
      <lb/>existimavi te admonere, quod <rs type="letter">epistolas</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Die hier erwähnten Schreiben Fardellas lassen sich nicht sicher identifizieren. Der <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517058805501">Brief Fardellas an Nicolaus I Bernoulli vom 11. Januar 1714</rs> berichtet von der Werbung für Johann, erklärt diese aber bereits für zurückgenommen. Er lässt sich deshalb nicht ohne Weiteres mit den hier erwähnten Schreiben gleichsetzen, in denen Fardella Michelotti zur erneuten Werbung für Johann auffordert.</note> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nepoti</rs> acceperim ab <choice><abbr>Illus<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>triss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissimo</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>D.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Domino</expan></choice> Abbate <rs key="pers_DE-588-119291967" type="person">Fardella</rs>; quibus ipse me rogat ut <choice><abbr>Illustriss:<hi rend="sup">um</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissimum</expan></choice>
      <lb/>et <choice><abbr>Excell:<hi rend="sup">um</hi></abbr><expan>Excellentissimum</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>D:<hi rend="sup">um</hi></abbr><expan>Dominum</expan></choice> Moderatorem <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410" type="person">Ruzzini</rs> accedam quamprimum,
      <lb/>ipsumque adhorter ut tibi honorificum stipendium proponat, te<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>que vocet pro edocendis <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavii</rs> mathematicis disciplinis.<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Die Werbung um Johann I Bernoulli ging auf einen Vorschlag von Leibniz zurück. Fardella gab diesen Vorschlag entgegen Leibniz’ Wunsch nach Geheimhaltung an venezianische Senatoren weiter. Davon berichtet er in seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517058805501">Brief an Nicolaus I Bernoulli vom 11. Januar 1714</rs>. Nach Michelottis Darstellung verzögerte die Hoffnung, Johann für den Lehrstuhl zu gewinnen, die Berufung seines Neffen Nicolaus I Bernoulli.</note> Idem
      <lb/><choice><abbr>D.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Dominus</expan></choice> Abbas <rs key="pers_DE-588-119291967" type="person">Fardella</rs> mihi communicavit id quod propriis auribus
      <lb/>audivi, et de quo certiorem feci in antecedentibus meis <rs key="B_991170517054205501" type="letter">epistolis</rs>
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Doctiss.<hi rend="sup">im<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></hi></abbr><expan>Doctissimum</expan></choice> Nepotem tuum <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaum</rs>: nimirum quod <choice><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissimus</expan></choice> et
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Excell.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Excellentissimus</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>D.</abbr><expan>Dominus</expan></choice> Moderator <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410" type="person">Ruzzini</rs> <choice><sic>E<choice><orig><g ref="#AE">Æ</g></orig><reg>Ae</reg></choice>ques</sic><corr>Eques</corr></choice> et <choice><abbr>D.</abbr><expan>Divi</expan></choice> Marci Procurator
      <lb/>Amplissimus maximo exardeat desiderio te vocandi, et optimo stipen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dio <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavium</rs> convehendi ad Mathematum <rs type="organisation">Cathedram</rs> implen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dam. Idem desiderium <choice><abbr>Nobiliss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Nobilissimus</expan></choice> <choice><sic><choice><orig><g ref="#AE">Æ</g></orig><reg>Ae</reg></choice>ques</sic><corr>Eques</corr></choice> nominatus mihi commu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nicavit, et (ut aiebam in meis epistolis ad tuum <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nepotem</rs>)<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Vgl. Michelottis <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517054205501">Brief an Nicolaus I Bernoulli vom 20. April 1714</rs>. In seiner <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517053905501">Antwort vom 15. Mai 1714</rs> schätzte Nicolaus, ein Gehalt von etwa 1’500 Talern könne die Hindernisse für einen Wechsel seines Onkels überwinden. Dies ist zunächst Nicolaus’ Einschätzung. Johann erklärte am <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515019905501">15. August 1714</rs>, sein Neffe habe diese Summe ohne sein Wissen und ohne Rücksprache mit ihm genannt. Im eigenen <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515020205501">Brief vom 18. Juli 1714</rs> hatte Johann inzwischen selbst mindestens 1’500 Reichstaler im Wert von ebenso vielen Unzen Silber als Bedingung angegeben.</note>
      <lb/>subdidit te posse per biennium, triennium, aut quadriennium <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Pa<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tavii</rs> edocere, postea discedere cum certissima spe substituen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>di <choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">um</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimum</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nepotem</rs> tuum <choice><sic>sepius</sic><corr>s<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>pius</corr></choice> laudatum pro eadem <rs type="organisation">Cathedra</rs>
      <lb/>implenda. Pro te igitur difertur promotio ab hisce <choice><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">is</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissimis</expan></choice>
      <lb/>et <choice><abbr>Excell.<hi rend="sup">is</hi></abbr><expan>Excellentissimis</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>D. D.</abbr><expan>Dominis</expan></choice> Patavini <rs type="organisation">Archilyc<choice><orig><g ref="#ehat">ê</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>i</rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1111043582 pers_DE-588-1178371670" type="person">Moderatoribus</rs>, qui uti pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>vi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>deo, ambigunt vocare, et <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavium</rs> convehere Doctissimum <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Ne<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>potem</rs> tuum, quia iuvenis est, quiaque ipsum, te, in disciplinis
      <lb/>mathematicis inferiorem existimant. Ego profect<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> omnes meas
      <lb/>adhibui vires ut tandem viderem vocatum et honorific<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavium</rs> conductum Nepotem tuum <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaum</rs>, quem tan<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>quam eximium Mathematicum veneror: ver<choice><orig><g ref="#ugrav">ù</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>m maxima
      <lb/>tui fama, et Abbatis <rs key="pers_DE-588-119291967" type="person">Fardell<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> promissiones de tua fami<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>geratissima Persona, nescio quo fundamento fact<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, maxim<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>attulere damnum eidem <choice><abbr>D.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Domino</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nepoti</rs> tuo Mathematum <rs type="organisation">Cathedram</rs>
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavinam</rs> petenti. Te igitur pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>cor ut hanc meam epistolam
      <lb/>etiam perlegas <choice><abbr>Doctiss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Doctissimo</expan></choice> Nepoti tuo <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolao</rs>, ipsumque roges ut
      <lb/>meis epistolis (si ipsas accepit) respondeat; et eodem tempore
<pb facs="1078613" n="2"/>
      <lb/>ad me transmittas epistolam aliquam tuam, quam possim osten<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dere <choice><abbr>Illustriss:<hi rend="sup">is</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissimis</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr><choice><sic>Exell.</sic><corr>Excell.</corr></choice><hi rend="sup">is</hi></abbr><expan>Excellentissimis</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>D. D.</abbr><expan>Dominis</expan></choice> Patavini <rs type="organisation">Archilyc<choice><orig><g ref="#ehat">ê</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>i</rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1111043582 pers_DE-588-1178371670" type="person">Moderatoribus</rs>, et in
      <lb/>qua tuam mihi aperias super hac re voluntatem. Si <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavium</rs>
      <lb/>venire cupis ad Mathematum <rs type="organisation">Cathedram</rs> vacuam implendam
      <lb/>certo vocaberis, et illic<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> promoveberis; qua propter poteris in
      <lb/>tua <rs key="B_991170515020205501" type="letter">epistola</rs>, quam ad me quamprimum mittes, petere illud Sti<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>pendium annuum quod tibi lubebit. Sin ver<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> dictam <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavinam</rs>
      <lb/><rs type="organisation">Cathedram</rs> etiam pro honorifico stipendio recusas, propone <choice><abbr>D.<hi rend="sup">um</hi></abbr><expan>Dominum</expan></choice>
      <lb/>Nepotem tuum <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaum</rs>, dicque ipsum tibi in mathematicis
      <lb/>esse <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qualem; tuamque assertionem proba iisdem <choice><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">is</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissimis</expan></choice>
      <lb/>atque <choice><abbr>Excell:<hi rend="sup">is</hi></abbr><expan>Excellentissimis</expan></choice> <choice><sic><choice><orig><g ref="#AE">Æ</g></orig><reg>Ae</reg></choice>quitibus</sic><corr>Equitibus</corr></choice> aliqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> public<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> dissertatione mathe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>matica <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> <choice><abbr>Doctiss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Doctissimo</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nepote</rs> tuo componend<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>, illorumque nomi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nibus inscribend<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>.</p>
  <p><lb/>H<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c ut accipias rogo in signum me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> erga te, et <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nepotem</rs> tuum
      <lb/>benevolenti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>. Ego profecto te magni facio, et omnia tua, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> pu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>blici iuris fecisti scripta; magno prosequor amore <choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">um</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimum</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nico<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>laum</rs> Nepotem tuum, quem scio esse in mathematicis discipli<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nis maxim<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> habilem; ac proptere<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> vellem ut vel tu, vel ipse
      <lb/>honorabili stipendio in honorem Studii Patavini, vocaretur <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Pata<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>vium</rs> ab hac <choice><abbr>Potentiss.<hi rend="sup">a</hi></abbr><expan>Potentissima</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Sereniss.<hi rend="sup">a</hi></abbr><expan>Serenissima</expan></choice> <rs key="place_VER-repven" type="place">Republica</rs>.</p>
  <p><lb/>C<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>terum maximum mihi feceris favorem si fasciculum ex exem<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>plaribus operum Incomparabilis Fratris tui <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509950" type="person">Jacobi</rs>, tuorumque
      <lb/>ad me transmittes per Tabellarium. Maxim<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> expeto <rs key="biblio_WPXENY2H" type="biblio">librum de
      <lb/>Arte Coniectandi</rs>; Dissertationem tuam <rs key="biblio_W6BHQDM2" type="biblio">de effervescentia, et fer<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mentatione</rs>; et <rs key="biblio_RTB4565Q" type="biblio">Essai d’<choice><sic>un</sic><corr>une</corr></choice> <choice><sic>novelle</sic><corr>nouvelle</corr></choice> theorie sur la <choice><sic>Manuvre</sic><corr>Man<choice><orig><g ref="#oe">œ</g></orig><reg>oe</reg></choice>uvre</corr></choice> des
      <lb/>Vaisseaux <choice><sic>ec</sic><corr>etc</corr></choice></rs>. aliaque si qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> sunt tui aurea opuscula, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> h<choice><orig><g ref="#ihat">î</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>c non
      <lb/>inveniuntur. Fasciculum Tabellarii ope poteris transmittere
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3182164" type="place">Bergomum</rs>, ubi accipietur, et solventur omnes expens<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> nomi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ne meo ab <choice><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissimo</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Excell.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Excellentissimo</expan></choice> D. Comite <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089631200" type="person">Carolo Zenobio</rs> illius
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3182164" type="place">Civitatis</rs> Capitaneo. Inscriptio autem supra fasciculum facien<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>da poterit esse hujusmodi<choice><orig>.</orig><reg>:</reg></choice> A S. Eccellenza <choice><abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">r</hi></abbr><expan>Signor</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">r</hi></abbr><expan>Signor</expan></choice> Padrone mio <choice><abbr>Collmo</abbr><expan>Collendissimo</expan></choice>
      <lb/>il <choice><abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">r</hi></abbr><expan>Signor</expan></choice> Conte <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089631200" type="person">Carlo Zenobio</rs> Capitano di <rs key="place_GEO-3182164" type="place">Bergamo</rs>. Fasciculum
      <lb/>autem concitari debebit epistola eiusdem inscriptionis, in qua
      <lb/>erit occlusa epistola, quam ad me eodem tempore <choice><sic>trasmittere</sic><corr>transmittere</corr></choice>
<pb facs="1078614" n="3"/>
      <lb/>dignaberis.</p>
  <p><lb/></p><closer><salute>Vale plurimum, saluta <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me <choice><abbr>Doctiss.<hi rend="sup">um</hi></abbr><expan>Doctissimum</expan></choice> Nepotem tuum <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaum</rs>;
      <lb/>meque amare perge.
      <lb/>Tui
      <lb/>Addictissimus et <choice><abbr>Obsequentiss<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Obsequentissimus</expan></choice> servus.</salute>
      <lb/><signed><rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petrus Antonius Michelotti.</rs></signed>
